<section style="padding: 5rem 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-ink); background-color: var(--color-cream); position: relative;">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 3.5rem; align-items: center;">
      <!-- Left Content -->
      <div>
        <span class="pill pill-sun" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">The Experience</span>
        <h2 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Discovery is a form of <span style="color: var(--color-berry);">regional pride.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-ink-soft" style="font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          You already screenshot storefronts and keep a "places to try" list. The box arrives already vouched for — independent brands curated by locals, reading as insider knowledge rather than digital marketing.
        </p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem;">
            <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--color-teal); border: 2px solid var(--color-ink); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;">
              {% render 'icon-check' %}
            </span>
            <span>Six regional brands to try at once — one small treat, not a chore.</span>
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem;">
            <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--color-teal); border: 2px solid var(--color-ink); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;">
              {% render 'icon-check' %}
            </span>
            <span>Exclusive first-order offers & QR perks you won't find anywhere else.</span>
          </li>
          <li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem;">
            <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--color-teal); border: 2px solid var(--color-ink); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;">
              {% render 'icon-check' %}
            </span>
            <span>Perfect gift for newcomers, locals, and homesick expats who love their home state.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/pages/subscribe" class="btn btn-coral btn-lg">
            <span>Join Season Pass</span>
            {% render 'icon-arrow-right' %}
          </a>
          <a href="/pages/for-brands" class="btn btn-teal btn-lg">
            <span>Are you a maker?</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Graphic / Mascot Card -->
      <div style="position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: center;">
        <div style="border-radius: var(--radius-xl); border: 2px solid var(--color-ink); background-color: var(--color-sun); padding: 2.5rem 2rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-pop-lg); width: 100%; max-width: 440px; text-align: center;">
          <figure class="mascot-container" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
            <img src="{{ 'lo_mascot.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Lo the Strawberry Mascot" style="height: 180px; width: auto; margin: 0 auto;">
            <figcaption class="mascot-caption" style="font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Lo says: "Taste local, live happy!"</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div style="background-color: var(--color-paper); border: 2px solid var(--color-ink); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.25rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow-pop-sm);">
            <div style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
              Support Your Neighbors
            </div>
            <p class="text-ink-soft" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
              Over 85% of dollars spent with local businesses stay within your community. Every box is an investment in regional vitality.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Regional Pride",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Regional Pride"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
